.TH bap-complete 1  "bap-complete " 
.SH NAME
bap\-complete \- Emit a shell completion script for bap
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbap\-complete\fR [\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISHELL\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Emit a shell completion script for bap
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fI<OUT>\fR
Write to this file instead of stdout
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISHELL\fR>
Shell to generate completions for
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
bash
.IP \(bu 2
elvish
.IP \(bu 2
fish
.IP \(bu 2
powershell
.IP \(bu 2
zsh
.RE
